sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Backend
  participant AG as Agent (LLM + Tools)

  U->>FE: Atur target, profile & model, klik "Run Scan"
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/dynamic/scan
  API-->>FE: 202 Accepted (scan_id)
  Note over API,AG: Scan berjalan di background

  API->>AG: Mulai agent loop
  loop Sampai selesai (final / batas langkah)
    AG->>AG: LLM pilih tool, jalankan, catat temuan
  end
  AG->>API: Simpan hasil + laporan

  loop User cek berkala
    FE->>API: GET /api/v1/scans/{scan_id}
    API-->>FE: Status (running / selesai)
  end
  FE-->>U: Tampilkan hasil scan + laporan
